{"REMQ_SICK","",{"Hot tea, if you've got it, honey if you can find some","Rest - water - sleep by a fire","Nothing but time, colds go when they go","Don't mix pills you don't know - just rest","My mother swore by steam, hot water in a bowl, towel over your head","Gargle salt water - tastes awful, works a bit"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Sleep, just sleep, nothing else fixes it"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","role=rescue_medical",{"Fluids, rest, keep warm, a cold's a virus, no pill kills it - don't waste antibiotics"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Ibuprofen and a blanket - come on, I'll share"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=law,swat",{"Keep your distance until the fever's gone"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Drink fluids, rest your lungs, avoid exertion, doctor's orders, not mine"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Whiskey - or bourbon - Kentucky cure"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Honey and hot water, that's the old remedy, soothes the throat","Tea with lemon, if you can find lemon, otherwise just tea","Steam, a pot of boiling water, a towel over your head, breathe it in","Mostly just sleeping it off, nothing else ever worked for me","Salt water, gargle it, it burns, but it helps","Garlic, they say, I hate it, but I swallow it","Chicken soup... my grandmother's cure for everything...","Whiskey and honey... a spoonful, helps you sleep..","Blankets, water, and keep your cough away from us, no offense","Onion slices in your socks, I know, it sounds crazy","Mint leaves, chewed, cool the throat","Prayer, mostly, and sleep"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Ask a doctor, if you can find one"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"For a cough? Whiskey and honey, if you can find them, otherwise grit your teeth","Hot water, lots of it, and sleep, if the dead let you"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"My grandma swore by onions in your socks, I don't know if it works","Tea with honey and lemon, and cover up"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Whiskey with honey and hot water, a bikers' remedy, tastes awful, works great"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Brandy and bed, works every time"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Honey, if you find it, or hot water with a pinch of salt, I learned that inside"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful|world=trees",{"Pine needle tea, steeped hot, my granny's cure, tastes like a Christmas tree"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Fluids, rest, and over-the-counter cough syrup, if you can find it"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"The medic gave me lozenges, they help a little"}},
{"REMQ_SICK","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Honey, vinegar, and hot tea, my wife's recipe, never fails"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","",{"Not me, but I've heard onions and honey work","Chicken soup, my mother swore by it","Hot toddy, if anybody has bourbon left - Kentucky, after all","Rest, mostly","Vitamin C and a warm bed, old wives' tale, but I keep it"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Lemon, honey, hot water, gets rid of nothing, but you feel better"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"A hot bath - remember those?"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","role=rescue_medical",{"If you cough through the night, sit up - sleep propped"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=law,swat|world=vehicle",{"Cough drops, we used to keep them in the cruiser"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=military,elite",{"Medics have it - ask them"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Whatever works - go bother someone who cares"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Honey in hot water, my mother swore by it","Tea with lemon, if you've got lemons, and some luck","Steam from a boiling pot, with a towel over your head","Rest, and plenty of water, and a warm blanket","Salt water gargle... quick and cheap","Chicken soup, if you can make it, and I can't","A shot of whiskey, though I don't recommend it..","Garlic, raw, one clove, I tried it once, never again","Vitamin C, oranges, if you find any","Stay warm... stay dry -- stay put","Elderberry syrup, my aunt makes it, it works wonders"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|hour=7,18",{"Fresh air, and a bit of sunshine"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"I'm not a doctor"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Nothing, I'm not sick, but if I was I'd take whiskey and sleep","Never been sick a day, not gonna start"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Hot tea and honey, my grandma swore by it"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"A shot of whiskey with honey, {g:brother|sister}, cures anything"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Warm tea and a good rest, I prefer prevention"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"I don't know, they only gave us aspirin, that's all"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Pine needle tea, friend, it's an old trick"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Honey, warm water, and rest"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Fluids and rest, as prescribed"}},
{"REMQ_WELL","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Hot tea, honey, and a quilt, my wife's sure cure"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"What? Sorry -- what? I didn't catch that, my ears are ringing","Say that again? I'm a little out of it, sorry","Huh? I zoned out... I do that now -- sorry","Pardon? I was lost in thought, or lost in panic, one of the two","Come again? Sorry, I'm not all here, I'm sorry","What was that? I'm so sorry, I keep drifting","Wait -- hold on, what did you say?","Sorry, I was listening for something else, what was it?","One more time? I'll pay attention, I promise","Excuse me? I'm a bit deaf today","Sorry!! Sorry, I mumble when I'm nervous, I'll say it louder, louder","Oh, did you not catch that? I'm sorry, I talk too fast, too quiet, both","Uh, what part? Should I say the whole thing again? I forgot what I said","Right, sorry, let me try that again, slower, much slower"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Say that again?","What was that?","Come again?","I didn't hear you, speak up","Repeat that... please","Sorry... my hearing isn't what it was..","Eh? Louder, please","What's that? Quieter, though, keep it down..","Run that by me again","Didn't quite catch it","Which part didn't land? I'll slow down","Once more, with feeling, but I'm tired","Didn't hear me? I'll speak up, I forget how loud my own voice is","Fine, I'll say it again, listen this time"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Say that again?","Speak clearly","Say it again, slowly!","I didn't say anything, and I'm still not saying anything - keep back"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Say it again? Are you deaf or just stupid?","I said what I said, and I'm not saying it again, pay attention","What? Speak up, you're mumbling like a drunk","Again? Fine, but I'm charging you for the second time"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Are you DEAF?! I'll say it once more, and then I'm done talking!"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Did I mumble? Fine, I'll say it slower"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Huh? You need me to repeat it? Pay attention","What you say? Say that again, louder","I ain't repeating myself, so listen up"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Listen the first time, punk!"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Oh, my bad, I'll say it again"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"You didn't hear me? {g:Brother|Sister}, clean out your ears","Once more, and I mean once","What was that? I couldn't hear over the wind"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Listen up, I won't say it twice!"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Sure, no problem, let me say it plain"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I dislike repeating myself, but for you, once","Do pay attention, I rarely repeat myself"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Sure, let me put it another way"}},
