{"REPEAT","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Come closer, dear, my voice isn't what it was"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'll repeat, listen carefully"}},
{"REPEAT","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Repeating, listen up"}},
