{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","",{"Leaves are turning - don't look too long, it'll make you sad","Best smell in the world, woodsmoke and apples","Football season, I still catch myself checking the schedule","Short days, long evenings - fire time","Harvest, whatever's still standing, take it"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Burley's hung in the barns, tobacco curing, nobody to sell it to"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"School would have started, I keep thinking about that"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=law,swat",{"Frost soon - get your supplies in"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Fall prep: fuel, firewood, food, in that order"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Best time of year to work, cool nights, long shadows"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Autumn's my favorite... the leaves, the smell of woodsmoke, the crisp air...","The harvest... if there is one, the pumpkins, the apples, the corn","It's a beautiful season, and a sad one, because it means winter","Everything dies so beautifully in the fall","The air has a bite to it, and I like it","We gather, we store, we prepare","It's the last good season, make the most of it","Orange, red, gold, I wish I could keep them in jars","I love it... and I dread it, a perfect mix...","Leaves crunch underfoot, and I jump at every sound","It's cozy, and it's creepy, in equal parts"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"Football on the radio, cider on the porch, I miss it terribly"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"It's fall, so what?"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful|world=road",{"Fall's nice, cool nights, quiet roads, and everybody's too busy hoarding to notice me"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Autumn smells like wood smoke and rot, and I've never been happier"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Fall, I miss football and my mama's pumpkin pie"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Fall rides are the best, {g:brother|sister}, colors on the hills, crisp air, no bugs"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Autumn has a certain elegance, even in a ruined world"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Fall, when the leaves turned and the guard let us stand out in the yard longer, I miss that"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful|world=trees",{"Fall's hunting season, friend, deer on the move, and the woods are loud with leaves"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Finally cooler, thank Christ, rot's slower too, I can think again"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Gotta stock up before winter hits, wood and canned food"}},
{"SEAQ_AUTUMN","role=militia|st=neutral,careful|hour=4,9",{"Harvest time, friend, we work from dawn till dusk, and sing while we do it"}},
{"SEAQ_SPRING","world=building",{"The first warm day, I sat on the porch and cried a little"}},
{"SEAQ_SPRING","",{"Mud, mostly, mud and redbuds","Things wake up, good things, bad things","Green's coming back, it feels wrong somehow, like nothing happened","Best season - worst timing"}},
